    <header class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-16 pb-12 px-6 md:px-12 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Privacy Policy for Veonb Shield</h1>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-400 bg-brand-900/30 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-500/30">
            Last updated: June 11, 2026
        </p>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pb-20 space-y-8">
        
        <!-- Intro -->
        <div class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
            We take the privacy and security of our users very seriously. This page clearly drafts how the bot handles, protects, and utilizes data to deliver our advanced automation, block systems, and real-time protection shields.
        </div>

        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="group bg-slate-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-brand-500/10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-brand-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-brand-400 font-bold text-xl">1.</span> The Data We Collect & Store
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4">To operate our fully automated moderation and shield systems, the bot ONLY stores minimum descriptive metadata in our secure MongoDB database:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    <span><strong class="text-slate-200">Discord User IDs:</strong> Required to uniquely identify members and manage their active ban/block states.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    <span><strong class="text-slate-200">Discord Role IDs:</strong> Used to accurately preserve and restore their original roles once punishment ends.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    <span><strong class="text-slate-200">Log IDs & Punishment Logs:</strong> Kept to document active and historic action audits for server administrators.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="group bg-slate-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-brand-500/10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-brand-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-brand-400 font-bold text-xl">2.</span> Crucial Note on Message Content
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-5">The bot temporarily processes deleted message content strictly and in real-time to relay it to the secure internal backup logging channels within your Discord server.</p>
            
            <div class="bg-amber-900/20 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mt-4 text-amber-200/90 flex gap-4 items-start">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
                </svg>
                <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    <strong class="text-amber-500">CRUCIAL NOTE:</strong> Absolutely NO message content is ever saved, extracted, or stored in our MongoDB or any external databases. Native text processing is transient, staying only in warm memory, and is discarded immediately after transmitting to your server.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section class="group bg-slate-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-brand-500/10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-brand-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-brand-400 font-bold text-xl">3.</span> How We Use the Data
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4">Stored descriptive metadata is strictly restricted to facilitating the server safety automation workflows:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-4">
                <li class="bg-slate-950/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-200 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                        Temporary Punishment Lifecycles
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-400">Tracking block durations and expiration intervals so the bot can automatically restore the user's original server permissions at the exact scheduled timestamp without human intervention.</p>
                </li>
                <li class="bg-slate-950/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-200 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.166 4.999A11.954 11.954 0 0010 1.944 11.954 11.954 0 0017.834 5c.11.65.166 1.32.166 2.001 0 5.225-3.34 9.67-8 11.317C5.34 16.67 2 12.225 2 7c0-.682.057-1.35.166-2.001zm11.541 3.708a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                        Anti-Abuse Shield System
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-400">Monitoring server-side role changes in real-time to detect, rollback, and prevent any unauthorized manual role adjustments bypasses.</p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section class="group bg-slate-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-brand-500/10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-brand-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-brand-400 font-bold text-xl">4.</span> Data Storage & Security
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4">All logged metadata resides safely within isolated sandboxes adhering to industry-leading standards:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-400 mt-2 shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(56,189,248,0.8)]"></div>
                    <span>We <strong class="text-rose-400">DO NOT</strong> (and will never) use collected metadata to train artificial intelligence (AI) models.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-400 mt-2 shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(56,189,248,0.8)]"></div>
                    <span>We never sell, trade, rent, or share server metadata with any third parties.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-400 mt-2 shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(56,189,248,0.8)]"></div>
                    <span>Access to the MongoDB database is strictly private and authenticated exclusively for automated software operations.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section class="group bg-slate-900/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-800 hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:bg-slate-800/80 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow-brand-500/10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-brand-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-brand-400 font-bold text-xl">5.</span> User Rights & Data Removal
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4">We support your digital footprint ownership and right to clear personal telemetry:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    <span>Users and server administrators can request continuous, permanent deletion of their metadata and logs at any point free of charge.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 mt-1 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                    <span>To submit a swift data purging request, simply contact the verified bot developer directly via Discord.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="w-full bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 py-8 text-center px-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <p class="text-slate-400 font-medium mb-2">&copy; 2026 Veonb Shield. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm flex items-center gap-1">
                Made with <span class="text-rose-500 animate-pulse text-lg">❤️</span> for community security
